title: "Pink Tax: A Data-Driven Analysis of Gender-Based Price Differences in Indian Online Retail"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Shah
    given-names: Kanishka
    affiliation: "SAL Engineering and Technical Institute, Gujarat Technological University"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mppyxx/PinkTax"
