date-released: 2026-09-30
abstract: >-
  Tests whether products marketed to women in India cost more than comparable
  products marketed to men, using 79,390 product listings (INR) from Myntra,
  BigBasket and Amazon.in across 44 categories. Summer Internship (3170001)
  project, B.E. Computer Science & Engineering, under the guidance of
  Prof. Himani Patel.
keywords:
